<<PlayBackgroundMusic Exciting_1>>
<<SetBGSprite KohliwadaGround>>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Captain. We did it. You did it. You are a star. Maa's medicines, Baba's knee towel, new soles for your shoes—

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Thanks bhai.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Humble and grounded. That's my boy.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Worried">>
Raju: I want to go home bhai. Can we leave? All this attention is making me nervous.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: When you play like that, people will clap. Acknowledge them. Don't be nervous.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Worried">>
Raju: I want to hide behind you. All these piercing eyes.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: I am aware. Those are eyes of appreciation. Eyes that are marveling at your talent. I am here with you. Hold my hand.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: Thanks bhai.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
<<FadeToBlack>>
